Objective: 
Find the password stored in data.txt on the line that only appears once.

Learned:
What piping and redirection is.

Commands used:
sort data.txt - Sorts file contents.
uniq -u data.txt - Prints out all unique lines.
sort data.txt | uniq -u - Piping the output of the left program to the right one where the only line left is the unique one.

